  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w19.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "読破合宿、今日から食堂で決行。理由はまかないに近いから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "読む係、疑う係、それと食べる係。全員、兼任です。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "頁をめくる風で、紙が飛んだ。湯呑みも三回、沸騰した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食堂のおばちゃんは動じない。「昔から、揉め事はここでやるんだよ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社案の弱点が、少しずつ見えてきた。「推奨」には拒否権、「任命」には同意がいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、決定打じゃない。拒否されても会社は次の手を出せる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "こっちには、ひっくり返す一枚が要る。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外、街は所有者グランプリの支度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "勝てば「編成裁量の保全」つまり、試合の場まで会社が用意して、そこで決めろと言っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……用意された土俵。そこが、ちょっと引っかかる。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三日目の夜、選手の一人が、ふいに手を止めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……ミミさん。これを」差し出された頁は茶色くて、手書きの字が並んでいた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「選手は、自らの物語の上演について異議を申し立てる権利を有する」上演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "試合じゃなくて、上演。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.direction.mimi.shift.007",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.confused",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "妙な言葉選び。耳が、ぴこん、と傾いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "闘技場の規定なのに、上演と書いてある。書いた人は、舞台だと思ってたのかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気になるけど、今は使い道が先。この一条は、選手本人の権利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社が何を決めても、本人が異議を出せる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが写しを取り、条番号を確かめた。現行版と突き合わせる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「削除されていません。忘れられているだけです」消されていない規定は、生きている規定。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "食堂に、静かな熱がこもった。誰も万歳はしない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "かわりに、全員がまた自分の巻に戻った。武器はひとつ、見つかった。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その夜、ノノさんと書式を起こした。古い一条を根拠にした異議申立の様式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "申立人の欄は、空欄のまま。書くのは、本人たち。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仕上がりを眺めて、ノノさんが言った。「美しい書式です。会社のより、美しいです」",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "解散間際、ノノさんがカレンダーに丸を付けた。回答期限まで、あと一週間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w19.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "丸の隣の週は、所有者グランプリ。決戦まで、あと少し。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w19.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
